{"text": "The day came, and the arena was filled with thousands of people. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The young man walked in, tall and handsome, and bowed to the king. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But his eyes went straight to the princess, who sat at her fathers right side. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With gold and the power of her will, the princess had learned the secret of the doors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She knew in which room the tiger waited and in which room the lady stood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She also knew who the lady was, and she hated her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had seen that lady look at the young man with admiring eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sometimes she thought he had looked back at her, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her jealous heart burned with hatred for that beautiful lady. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The young man looked at her, and he understood at once that she knew the secret.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "d", "a", "y", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", "n", "a", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "i", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", ",", " ", "t", "a", "l", "l", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "a", "n", "d", "s", "o", "m", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "o", "w", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "s", "t", "r", "a", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p",